Repeal the subsection but not the penalty substitute
	1	Subject to subsection 2 the owner or occupier of premises entered by an authorized officer under this Part must if requested by an authorized officer to do so provide reasonable assistance to the authorized officer for the purpose of the exercise of the authorized officers powers under this Part in relation to the premises
