	a	the exercise by that person or those persons of the powers of an authorized officer under this Act or of such of those powers as are specified in the instrument or
	b	the performance by that person or those persons of the functions of an authorized officer under this Act or of such of those functions as are specified in the instrument
23  Subsections 221 and 2
